  itemType: 3
  description: '<b>SOVIETS ABANDON ATOMIC SERUM: KHRUSHCHEV HALTS SECRET VACCINE
    RESEARCH</b>

    MOSCOW The Soviet Union has abruptly terminated its highly
    classified effort to replicate the American uranium-based vaccine. Soviet Premier
    Nikita Khrushchev officially canceled the research this morning, citing the violent
    "Atomic Relapse" currently ravaging U.S. cities as the primary reason for abandoning
    the project.

    "The American imperialists tried to replace honest, earthly
    food with radioactive poison, and now their citizens are tearing each other apart
    for a scrap of meat," Khrushchev declared to the Supreme Soviet. "The Soviet
    people will not be subjects of atomic starvation. We rely on the unbreakable
    strength of socialist agriculture!"

    While Moscow previously denied any
    interest in the serum, Western intelligence reveals that the KGB had successfully
    stolen the original formula late last year. CIA operatives report that top Soviet
    scientists were just weeks away from beginning mass human trials in a closed
    Siberian city when reports of the ravenous, violent withdrawals in America reached
    the Kremlin.

    Spooked by the prospect of starving, aggressive mobs destabilizing
    Soviet industry, Khrushchev immediately pulled the plug. The clandestine laboratories
    have been dismantled, scientists reassigned, and the Kremlin is now flooding
    the Eastern Bloc with propaganda touting the absolute superiority of "traditional,
    socialist bread."'
